! Welcome to the Lararium

This wiki opens on the house landing. A lararium node keeps a place: its records rest in bags, the wikis compose those bags, and the page you read mirrors one wiki through a port onto its vessel.

* The road the house walks toward stable founding: <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road`>>
* What the house names a Lararium, and how its parts hold together: <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/lararium`>>

A wiki names its own landing by tagging a record of its bags `$:/tags/lares/Landing`; the house's `$:/DefaultTiddlers` reads that tag and falls back to TiddlyWiki's GettingStarted where no landing stands. A wiki that authors its own `$:/DefaultTiddlers` keeps it.

